thrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 3 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\sqrt{3} x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\sqrt{3}}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}}{3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "86099405-77c6-5190-8a2a-9987ead0ebf9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "86099405-77c6-5190-8a2a-9987ead0ebf9" :question/answer-fields "3635e6b1-85d6-5b93-b14d-7ce3dbc289ab"] [:db/ensure "86099405-77c6-5190-8a2a-9987ead0ebf9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "86099405-77c6-5190-8a2a-9987ead0ebf9"] [:db/add "c7e001ab-cad0-5388-aeb9-ba256ce34f46" :answer/id #uuid "c7e001ab-cad0-5388-aeb9-ba256ce34f46"] [:db/add "c7e001ab-cad0-5388-aeb9-ba256ce34f46" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c7e001ab-cad0-5388-aeb9-ba256ce34f46" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(5 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "c7e001ab-cad0-5388-aeb9-ba256ce34f46" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b" :answer/id #uuid "1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b"] [:db/add "1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{25}+C"] [:db/ensure "1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "73afaad6-3cc0-5ad1-b38f-24a51fbfb172" :answer/id #uuid "73afaad6-3cc0-5ad1-b38f-24a51fbfb172"] [:db/add "73afaad6-3cc0-5ad1-b38f-24a51fbfb172" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "73afaad6-3cc0-5ad1-b38f-24a51fbfb172" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{25}+C"] [:db/ens