blem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\frac{1}{5}}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "00c0df7b-f3f7-5aef-8a44-20715d50042d" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=5 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{1}{5}}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(5 x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{5})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{25}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{25}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "00c0df7b-f3f7-5aef-8a44-20715d50042d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "00c0df7b-f3f7-5aef-8a44-20715d50042d" :question/answer-fields "28988c58-40b0-5576-90c1-baecb434fc34"] [:db/ensure "00c0df7b-f3f7-5aef-8a44-20715d50042d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "00c0df7b-f3f7-5aef-8a44-20715d50042d"] [:db/add "847e59e1-e3be-5d9d-8be7-63f32d39ed17" :answer/id #uuid "847e59e1-e3be-5d9d-8be7-63f32d39ed17"] [:db/add "847e59e1-e3be-5d9d-8be7-63f32d39ed17" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "847e59e1-e3be-5d9d-8be7-63f32d39ed17" :answer/value "4 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{7} x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "847e59e1-e3be-5d9d-8be7-63f32d39ed17" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8494d033-7069-5320-8d91-c79268ff4287" :answer/id #uuid "8494d033-7069-5320-8d91-c79268ff4287"] [:db/add "8494d033-7069-5320-8d91-c79268ff4287" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8494d033-7069-5320-8d91-c79268ff4287" :answer/value "\\