91-a117-a20a71465d0f" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=2 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{9}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(2 x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9(\\frac{1}{2})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{9}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{9 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{9 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "ce5bfc5d-dffe-5991-a117-a20a71465d0f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "ce5bfc5d-dffe-5991-a117-a20a71465d0f" :question/answer-fields "1e8caa8a-5915-593c-9748-faadedfc7bcc"] [:db/ensure "ce5bfc5d-dffe-5991-a117-a20a71465d0f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "ce5bfc5d-dffe-5991-a117-a20a71465d0f"] [:db/add "29c4591a-0088-5834-a563-f44a66bce641" :answer/id #uuid "29c4591a-0088-5834-a563-f44a66bce641"] [:db/add "29c4591a-0088-5834-a563-f44a66bce641" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "29c4591a-0088-5834-a563-f44a66bce641" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "29c4591a-0088-5834-a563-f44a66bce641" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a54a7a68-3cbc-5153-bdfb-83f4b687d385" :answer/id #uuid "a54a7a68-3cbc-5153-bdfb-83f4b687d385"] [:db/add "a54a7a68-3cbc-5153-bdfb-83f4b687d385" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a54a7a68-3cbc-5153-bdfb-83f4b687d385" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{10}+C"] [:db/ensure "a54a7a68-3cbc-5153-bdfb-83f4b687d385" :answer/validate] [:db/add "58f72fc4-f805-5a35-acfe-283e69f73462" :an