nswer-field/correct "88c6b615-b8be-51c5-a731-8dbc27f69f86"] [:db/ensure "b62a0ac4-4910-5d87-9766-e2bf18b756a7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5" :question/id #uuid "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5"] [:db/add "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - 10 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=\\sqrt{10} x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\sqrt{10},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - 10 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\sqrt{10} x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{10}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{10}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5" :question/answer-fields "b62a0ac4-4910-5d87-9766-e2bf18b756a7"] [:db/ensure "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5"] [:db/add "c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb" :answer/id #uuid "c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb"] [:db/add "c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "941ef9f9-6159-51e1-a7dc-d50c626d0558" :answer/id #uuid "941ef9f9-6159-51e1-a7dc-d50c626d0558"] [:db/add "941ef9f9-6159-51e1-a7dc-d50c626d0558" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "941ef9f9-6159-51e1-a7dc-d50c626d0558" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "941ef9f9-6159-51e1-a7dc-d50c626d0558" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aa1b0bcb-60f1-50c6-b296-5783cec35c57" :answer/id #uuid "aa1b0bcb-60f1-50c6-b296-5783cec35c57"] [:db/add "aa1b0bcb-60f1-50c6-b296-5783cec35c57" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "aa1b0bcb-60f1-50c6-b296-5783cec35c57" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "aa1b0bcb-60f1-50c6-b296-5783cec35c57" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c74cc787-2dd0-5b0e-96b7-74518b5f3d84" :answer/id #uuid "c74cc787-2dd0-5b0e-96b7-74518b5f3d84"] [:db/add "c74cc787-2dd0-5b0e-96b7-74518b5f3d84" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c74cc787-2dd0-5b0e-96b7-74518b5f3d84" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "c74cc787-2dd0-5b0e-96b7-74518b5f3d84" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5e5c1395-3180-5893-89d4-0f9891c571e5" :answer/id #uuid "5e5c1395-3180-5893-89d4-0f9891c571e5"] [:db/add "5e5c1395-3180-5893-89d4-0f9891c571e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5e5c1395-3180-5893-89d4-0f9891c571e5" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "5e5c1395-3180-5893-89d4-0f9891c571e5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/id #uuid "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8"] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/choices "c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb"] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/choices "941ef9f9-6159-51e1-a7dc-d50c626d0558"] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/choices "aa1b0bcb-60f1-50c6-b296-5783cec35c57"] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/choices "c74cc787-2dd0-5b0e-96b7-74518b5f3d84"] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/choices "5e5c1395-3180-5893-89d4-0f9891c571e5"] [:db/add "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/correct "c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb"] [:db/ensure "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e" :question/id #uuid "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e"] [:db/add "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\frac{8}{5}}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{4(1-(\\frac{1}{4})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{2}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{8}{5}}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}(2)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{8}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e" :question/answer-fields "d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8"] [:db/ensure "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e"] [:db/add "0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92" :answer/id #uuid "0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92"] [:db/add "0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92" :answer/value "5 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{7} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d5c3fbd2-539a-534d-8878-d35f6bce05e3" :answer/id #uuid "d5c3fbd2-539a-534d-8878-d35f6bce05e3"] [:db/add "d5c3fbd2-539a-534d-8878-d35f6bce05e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d5c3fbd2-539a-534d-8878-d35f6bce05e3" :answer/value "5 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{7} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "d5c3fbd2-539a-534d-8878-d35f6bce05e3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a61d12cc-5846-5c95-8c47-c6df58f663fb" :answer/id #uuid "a61d12cc-5846-5c95-8c47-c6df58f663fb"] [:db/add "a61d12cc-5846-5c95-8c47-c6df58f663fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a61d12cc-5846-5c95-8c47-c6df58f663fb" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{7} \\right)}}{7}+C"] [:db/ensure "a61d12cc-5846-5c95-8c47-c6df58f663fb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1b7ae7f2-7de4-5833-95c5-d5a09eaa1bf6" :answer/id #uuid "1b7ae7f2-7de4-5833-95c5-d5a09eaa1bf6"] [:db/add "1b7ae7f2-7de4-5833-95c5-d5a09eaa1bf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1b7ae7f2-7de4-5833-95c5-d5a09eaa1bf6" :answer/value "5 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "1b7ae7f2-7de4-5833-95c5-d5a09eaa1bf6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9d812eb4-7438-5ddd-85c4-457629b790d6" :answer/id #uuid "9d812eb4-7438-5ddd-85c4-457629b790d6"] [:db/add "9d812eb4-7438-5ddd-85c4-457629b790d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9d812eb4-7438-5ddd-85c4-457629b790d6" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{7} \\right)}}{49}+C"] [:db/ensure "9d812eb4-7438-5ddd-85c4-457629b790d6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/id #uuid "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f"] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/choices "0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92"] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/choices "d5c3fbd2-539a-534d-8878-d35f6bce05e3"] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/choices "a61d12cc-5846-5c95-8c47-c6df58f663fb"] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/choices "1b7ae7f2-7de4-5833-95c5-d5a09eaa1bf6"] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/choices "9d812eb4-7438-5ddd-85c4-457629b790d6"] [:db/add "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/correct "0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92"] [:db/ensure "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604" :question/id #uuid "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604"] [:db/add "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{5}{\\sqrt{49 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{49 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{49(1-(\\frac{1}{49})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{7}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{7},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(7)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{5}{\\sqrt{49 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{7})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{7}(7)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 5\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 5 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 5 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{7} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604" :question/answer-fields "2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f"] [:db/ensure "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604"] [:db/add "d0d4aeaf-ef1e-5aa7-86c5-21d357f6e0bb" :answer/id #uuid "d0d4aeaf-ef1e-5aa7-86c5-21d357f6e0bb"] [:db/add "d0d4aeaf-ef1e-5aa7-86c5-21d357f6e0bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d0d4aeaf-ef1e-5aa7-86c5-21d357f6e0bb" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "d0d4aeaf-ef1e-5aa7-86c5-21d357f6e0bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3e32e157-a2bb-5778-9bc8-d1fe7100758f" :answer/id #uuid "3e32e157-a2bb-5778-9bc8-d1fe7100758f"] [:db/add "3e32e157-a2bb-5778-9bc8-d1fe7100758f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3e32e157-a2bb-5778-9bc8-d1fe7100758f" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "3e32e157-a2bb-5778-9bc8-d1fe7100758f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e1e2064c-c04d-51df-9f6c-3cfbbe08e677" :answer/id #uuid "e1e2064c-c04d-51df-9f6c-3cfbbe08e677"] [:db/add "e1e2064c-c04d-51df-9f6c-3cfbbe08e677" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e1e2064c-c04d-51df-9f6c-3cfbbe08e677" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{9}+C"] [:db/ensure "e1e2064c-c04d-51df-9f6c-3cfbbe08e677" :answer/validate] [:db/add "617c497a-66af-5f65-8666-45