hrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "fbda043b-7d01-51c0-ac35-cea779e23de9" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{81(1-(\\frac{1}{81})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{9}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{9},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(9)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{9}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{9})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{9}(9)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "fbda043b-7d01-51c0-ac35-cea779e23de9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "fbda043b-7d01-51c0-ac35-cea779e23de9" :question/answer-fields "8006da17-ecb9-5a36-aad0-18d773b11dd1"] [:db/ensure "fbda043b-7d01-51c0-ac35-cea779e23de9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "fbda043b-7d01-51c0-ac35-cea779e23de9"] [:db/add "492e234d-5019-5bc6-a8e0-a9ba061adba1" :answer/id #uuid "492e234d-5019-5bc6-a8e0-a9ba061adba1"] [:db/add "492e234d-5019-5bc6-a8e0-a9ba061adba1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "492e234d-5019-5bc6-a8e0-a9ba061adba1" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "492e234d-5019-5bc6-a8e0-a9ba061adba1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e7b88f32-5eb5-55b9-b209-fa037946585a" :answer/id #uuid "e7b88f32-5eb5-55b9-b209-fa037946585a"] [:db/add "e7b88f32-5eb5-55b9-b209-fa037946585a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e7b88f32-5eb5-55b9-b209-fa037946585a" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\