1b5-3488-52cf-9f07-cb54fab2995a" :answer-field/choices "9a3fc933-f396-51ab-81a9-5acbf7c80a86"] [:db/add "08a211b5-3488-52cf-9f07-cb54fab2995a" :answer-field/correct "e7b88f32-5eb5-55b9-b209-fa037946585a"] [:db/ensure "08a211b5-3488-52cf-9f07-cb54fab2995a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a" :question/id #uuid "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a"] [:db/add "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\frac{8}{5}}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{9(1-(\\frac{1}{9})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{3}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{8}{5}}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{8}{15}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{8}{15}(3)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{8}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a" :question/answer-fields "08a211b5-3488-52cf-9f07-cb54fab2995a"] [:db/ensure "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a"] [:db/add "4062997c-00f3-54d8-86c9-2088252c6427" :answer/id 