d/key "selection"] [:db/add "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/choices "4062997c-00f3-54d8-86c9-2088252c6427"] [:db/add "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/choices "e2b2290d-4132-52c9-ab25-6554b73deb8a"] [:db/add "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/choices "045c4ed0-9a0a-5238-a1ce-5fc55821d32a"] [:db/add "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/choices "a90839e2-0213-5afb-ae3e-1ddd2a32b599"] [:db/add "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/choices "06aa1893-7344-5203-8272-5774651e1595"] [:db/add "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/correct "e2b2290d-4132-52c9-ab25-6554b73deb8a"] [:db/ensure "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b" :question/id #uuid "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b"] [:db/add "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{36 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{36 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{36(1-(\\frac{1}{36})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{6}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{6},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(6)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{36 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{6})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{3}(6)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 2\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 2 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 2 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b" :question/answer-fields "e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124"] [:db/ensure "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b"] [:db/add "4cf126a6-16e3-5343-9783-4f334b632a2b" :answer/id #uuid "4cf126a6-16e3-5343-9783-4f334b632a2b"] [:db/add "4cf126a6-16e3-5343-9783-4f334b632a2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4cf126a6-16e3-5343-9783-4f334b632a2b" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "4cf126a6-16e3-5343-9783-4f334b632a2b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e3945987-f174-513e-b94e-49b9786ba73e" :answer/id #uuid "e3945987-f174-513e-b94e-49b9786ba73e"] [:db/add "e3945987-f174-513e-b94e-49b9786ba73e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e3945987-f174-513e-b94e-49b9786ba73e" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "e3945987-f174-513e-b94e-49b9786ba73e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "52d4c1aa-63cf-53a5-a1a4-e0c5f125159c" :answer/id #uuid "52d4c1aa-63cf-53a5-a1a4-e0c5f125159c"] [:db/add "52d4c1aa-63cf-53a5-a1a4-e0c5f125159c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "52d4c1aa-63cf-53a5-a1a4-e0c5f125159c" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "52d4c1aa-63cf-53a5-a1a4-e0c5f125159c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ee4959eb-87e3-53ab-818c-6eb129841585" :answer/id #uuid "ee4959eb-87e3-53ab-818c-6eb129841585"] [:db/add "ee4959eb-87e3-53ab-818c-6eb129841585" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ee4959eb-87e3-53ab-818c-6eb129841585" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}}{8}+C"] [:db/ensure "ee4959eb-87e3-53ab-818c-6eb129841585" :answer/validate] [:db/add "337e711f-9e4d-5552-bbfa-09963d5ba03b" 