verse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}(8)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "d6028e79-67ed-54bc-91ee-bc79ddc04de9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d6028e79-67ed-54bc-91ee-bc79ddc04de9" :question/answer-fields "9c2f8731-677b-5e51-83ba-52ef3602f024"] [:db/ensure "d6028e79-67ed-54bc-91ee-bc79ddc04de9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "d6028e79-67ed-54bc-91ee-bc79ddc04de9"] [:db/add "9da912b7-c82a-588d-aad3-9405b645cb2b" :answer/id #uuid "9da912b7-c82a-588d-aad3-9405b645cb2b"] [:db/add "9da912b7-c82a-588d-aad3-9405b645cb2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9da912b7-c82a-588d-aad3-9405b645cb2b" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{108}+C"] [:db/ensure "9da912b7-c82a-588d-aad3-9405b645cb2b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "836b8e2a-0a2f-57de-ab5a-09f3325f52ed" :answer/id #uuid "836b8e2a-0a2f-57de-ab5a-09f3325f52ed"] [:db/add "836b8e2a-0a2f-57de-ab5a-09f3325f52ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "836b8e2a-0a2f-57de-ab5a-09f3325f52ed" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{12}+C"] [:db/ensure "836b8e2a-0a2f-57de-ab5a-09f3325f52ed" :answer/validate] [:db/add "eeac7f1b-0800-5c25-bcb3-956419b51d97" :answer/id #uuid "eeac7f1b-0800-5c25-bcb3-956419b51d97"] [:db/add "eeac7f1b-0800-5c25-bcb3-956419b51d97" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eeac7f1b-0800-5c25-bcb3-956419b51d97" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operato