\frac{6}{5}}{\\sqrt{49 - 2 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "5d1a2e08-17a0-5035-83a4-af508eb0495e" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{49 - 2 x^{2}}=\\sqrt{49(1-(\\frac{2}{49})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{7}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{7},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{7 \\sqrt{2}}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{6}{5}}{\\sqrt{49 - 2 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{6}{35}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{7})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{6}{35}(\\frac{7 \\sqrt{2}}{2})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\right)}}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "5d1a2e08-17a0-5035-83a4-af508eb0495e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "5d1a2e08-17a0-5035-83a4-af508eb0495e" :question/answer-fields "24547e6f-5e45-537a-b8ff-884f262b7273"] [:db/ensure "5d1a2e08-17a0-5035-83a4-af508eb0495e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "5d1a2e08-17a0-5035-83a4-af508eb0495e"] [:db/add "7b27ebf9-81c0-5186-b894-864e87744f47" :answer/id #uuid "7b27ebf9-81c0-5186-b894-864e87744f47"] [:db/add "7b27ebf9-81c0-5186-b894-864e87744f47" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7b27ebf9-81c0-5186-b894-864e87744f47" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "7b27ebf9-81c0-5186-b894-864e87744f47" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4f664ff5-8ad0-5fbb-a886-4102a1c3c4e3" :answ