\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{7}{4}}{\\sqrt{25 - 5 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{20}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{20}(\\sqrt{5})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5}}{20}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{20}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\right)}}{20}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "06700047-ad1d-5b16-8026-a95be4f4bee9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "06700047-ad1d-5b16-8026-a95be4f4bee9" :question/answer-fields "62aed248-e6f8-5802-92f0-41cfc63b825b"] [:db/ensure "06700047-ad1d-5b16-8026-a95be4f4bee9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "06700047-ad1d-5b16-8026-a95be4f4bee9"] [:db/add "39fb2c59-5643-5a74-9272-aca623e70e85" :answer/id #uuid "39fb2c59-5643-5a74-9272-aca623e70e85"] [:db/add "39fb2c59-5643-5a74-9272-aca623e70e85" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "39fb2c59-5643-5a74-9272-aca623e70e85" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "39fb2c59-5643-5a74-9272-aca623e70e85" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1fbe9b1d-f277-5dc4-b54d-ce84ab329d1b" :answer/id #uuid "1fbe9b1d-f277-5dc4-b54d-ce84ab329d1b"] [:db/add "1fbe9b1d-f277-5dc4-b54d-ce84ab329d1b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1fbe9b1d-f277-5dc4-b54d-ce84ab329d1b" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "1fbe9b1d-f277-5dc4-b54d-ce84ab329d1b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b002eeca-bc61-5614-b62b-8eec96416915" :answer/id #uuid "b002eeca-bc61-5614-b62b-8eec96416915"] [:db