/correct "b002eeca-bc61-5614-b62b-8eec96416915"] [:db/ensure "d8e1c793-b298-5ef3-8a3d-aeb9c648f8f7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788" :question/id #uuid "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788"] [:db/add "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 2 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 2 x^{2}}=\\sqrt{4(1-(\\frac{1}{2})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\sqrt{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 2 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{2})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{2} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{2} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\right)}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788" :question/answer-fields "d8e1c793-b298-5ef3-8a3d-aeb9c648f8f7"] [:db/ensure "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788"] [:db/add "acf640ac-2120-5fb5-8cf7-f2e16ceb502a" :answer/id #uuid "acf640ac-2120-5fb5-8cf7-f2e16ceb502a"] [:db/add "acf640ac-2120-5fb5-8cf7-f2e16ceb502a" :answe