on "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - 7 x^{2}}=\\sqrt{9(1-(\\frac{7}{9})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{7} x}{3}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{3},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{3 \\sqrt{7}}{7})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{9}{\\sqrt{9 - 7 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{7} x}{3})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 3(\\frac{3 \\sqrt{7}}{7})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{9 \\sqrt{7}}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{9 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{7}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{9 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{7} x}{3} \\right)}}{7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "c3725f6e-6465-5347-b4c3-9fbe02106733" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c3725f6e-6465-5347-b4c3-9fbe02106733" :question/answer-fields "6669c3de-2402-5ecc-b193-85ab401d4cad"] [:db/ensure "c3725f6e-6465-5347-b4c3-9fbe02106733" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "c3725f6e-6465-5347-b4c3-9fbe02106733"] [:db/add "78711e5b-6114-5c41-a3f6-b0b103bd7cbc" :answer/id #uuid "78711e5b-6114-5c41-a3f6-b0b103bd7cbc"] [:db/add "78711e5b-6114-5c41-a3f6-b0b103bd7cbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "78711e5b-6114-5c41-a3f6-b0b103bd7cbc" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{15}+C"] [:db/ensure "78711e5b-6114-5c41-a3f6-b0b103bd7cbc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bc10dfc0-5725-5c3c-912b-175284c24be8" :answer/id #uuid "bc10dfc0-5725-5c3c-912b-175284c24be8"] [:db/add "bc10dfc0-5725-5c3c-912b-175284c24be8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bc10dfc0-5725-5c3c-912b-1