679b27a5-90c8-5515-b2e2-800cae783b34" :answer-field/choices "4d38b5e3-3659-5a61-900d-e832f7846ae6"] [:db/add "679b27a5-90c8-5515-b2e2-800cae783b34" :answer-field/choices "b2540c98-63e3-50df-9fd4-f4149cfcdb93"] [:db/add "679b27a5-90c8-5515-b2e2-800cae783b34" :answer-field/correct "4d38b5e3-3659-5a61-900d-e832f7846ae6"] [:db/ensure "679b27a5-90c8-5515-b2e2-800cae783b34" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "95936323-2406-5bb2-859c-74d73dc5a714" :question/id #uuid "95936323-2406-5bb2-859c-74d73dc5a714"] [:db/add "95936323-2406-5bb2-859c-74d73dc5a714" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\frac{6}{5}}{\\sqrt{9 - 3 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "95936323-2406-5bb2-859c-74d73dc5a714" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - 3 x^{2}}=\\sqrt{9(1-(\\frac{1}{3})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\sqrt{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{6}{5}}{\\sqrt{9 - 3 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{2}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{2}{5}(\\sqrt{3})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "95936323-2406-5bb2-859c-74d73dc5a714" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "95936323-2406-5bb2-859c-74d73dc5a714" :question/answer-fields "679b27a5-90c8-5515-b2e2-800cae783b34"] [:db/ensure "95936323-